<title>USA: Costa Mesa, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Costa Mesa, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $11.875 million of Costa Mesa, Calif., 1997 public parking refunding project, certificates of participation, with a true interest cost of 5.727 percent.</p>
</text>
